OL,3,GNEWSAChurch to make delayed move to
OL,4,Aformer pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA church which has faced a year of
OL,7,Fdelays over a planned move to a former
OL,8,Fpub now expects to be in its new home
OL,9,Ffor Christmas.
OL,11,FKings Church Gateshead was granted
OL,12,Fpermission to move to the former
OL,13,FRailway Club on Wellington Street last
OL,14,Fyear after it lost its former rented
OL,15,Fbuilding and was left hosting services
OL,16,Fin a local primary school.
OL,18,FPastor Paul Ellison said it had to
OL,19,Ffinalise the sale of the site from its
OL,20,Fprevious owner and complete renovation
OL,21,Fwork, but the first sermon in the new
OL,22,Fspace should be held by November.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
